    workDetails: "We are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Angular Developer to design, develop, and maintain web applications using Node.js and Angular. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience across both backend and frontend development, with a strong understanding of building scalable, efficient, and user-friendly applications.\n\n-- Key Responsibilities:\n\nDesign, develop, and maintain full stack web applications using Node.js and Angular.\n\nBuild and manage backend services, APIs, and server-side logic using Node.js.\n\nDevelop responsive and dynamic frontend components using Angular.\n\nIntegrate frontend applications with backend services and RESTful APIs.\n\nWork with databases (SQL/NoSQL) for data storage, retrieval, and optimization.\n\nEnsure application performance, security, and scalability.\n\nDebug, troubleshoot, and resolve application issues across the stack.\n\nCollaborate with designers, QA, and other developers to deliver high-quality solutions.\n\nParticipate in code reviews and follow best coding practices.\n\nStay updated with emerging technologies and industry best practices.\n\n--Required Skills & Qualifications:\n\nHands-on experience with Node.js for backend development.\n\nExperience working with Angular for frontend development.\n\nUnderstanding of RESTful APIs and full stack architecture.\n\nFamiliarity with databases (MySQL, MongoDB, or similar).\n\nBasic understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\nGood problem-solving and analytical skills.\n\nAbility to work independently and in a team environment.\n\nStrong communication and collaboration skills.\n\nPreferred Skills (Good to Have)\n\nExperience with version control tools like Git.\n\nBasic knowledge of cloud platforms or deployment processes.\n\nExposure to authentication, authorization, and security concepts.\n\nUnderstanding of software development best practices and design patterns.\n\nExperience: 2 Year\n\nLocation: INFOPARK, KOCHI\n\nJoiner: IMMEDIATE JOINER\n\nAPPLY: Send your resume to hrteam@touchworldtechnology.com\n\n If this opportunity aligns with your career goals, kindly share your updated resume with us at hrteam@touchworldtechnology.com",
