    companyDetails: "Infintor Solutions LLP — listed on the official Infopark jobs portal.",
    workDetails: "⚠️ IMPORTANT APPLICANT NOTICE\n\nExperience Level: This is a senior-level, individual contributor role requiring a proven B2B sales track record. Applications from freshers will not be considered.\n\nHow to Apply: Applications will only be accepted via the official \"Apply\" option within this job posting. Direct emails, WhatsApp or messages outside this platform will bypass our tracking system.\n\nAbout the Role\n\nWe are looking for a relentless, self-starting Business Development Manager (BDM) to build our global and enterprise outbound sales pipeline from scratch. This is a pure \"hunter\" role designed for an individual contributor who thrives on finding hidden opportunities, navigating corporate gatekeepers, and opening doors directly at the CXO level.\n\nYou will not rely on inbound leads or software publisher referrals. Instead, you will use targeted, direct outbound strategies to win high-ticket Odoo Enterprise implementation, migration, and consulting contracts. While you have the freedom to tap into high-growth international markets like the GCC and Europe, you will also actively target mid-to-large corporate clients right here in India who demand high-value, premium enterprise solutions.\n\nCore Responsibilities\n\nDirect Outbound Sourcing: Independently research, list, and map mid-market and enterprise accounts globally and domestically (specifically targeting verticals like Manufacturing, Supply Chain, Logistics, and Trading running legacy or unmaintained ERP systems).\n\nStrategic Market Prioritization: Execute focused outbound campaigns across the GCC (leveraging regional triggers like e-invoicing compliance), Western Europe, and high-ticket Indian domestic corporate sectors.\n\nJob-Board Interception: Track international and domestic job boards for companies hunting for in-house Odoo talent or struggling with messy implementations, and pivot those into agency service pitches directly to CIOs and CFOs.\n\nHyper-Personalized Outreach: Execute outbound hunting cadences via LinkedIn Sales Navigator, personalized cold email, and consultative phone outreach to target CIOs, IT Directors, and CFOs.",
