    workDetails: "We're Hiring: Google Ads Expert (Mandatory Experience in IT SECTOR)\n\nPay: ₹50,000.00-₹60,000.00 per month\n\n📍 Location: Infopark, Kochi (Onsite)\n\n💼 Employment Type: Full-Time\n\n📅 Experience Required: 5+ Years\n\nJachOOS Technologies is looking for an experienced and results-oriented Digital Marketing & Google Ads Manager to lead our international digital marketing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have proven expertise in Google Ads, B2B lead generation, SEO, social media marketing, and performance marketing for global markets.\n\n🔹 Key Responsibilities:\n\n• Plan, execute, and optimize Google Ads campaigns (Search, Display, YouTube, Performance Max & Remarketing)\n\n• Manage paid campaigns across Google, LinkedIn, Facebook, and Instagram\n\n• Drive qualified B2B lead generation campaigns targeting international markets\n\n• Develop and optimize marketing funnels, landing pages, and conversion strategies\n\n• Lead SEO initiatives, including On-Page, Off-Page, and Technical SEO\n\n• Manage social media growth and engagement strategies\n\n• Track campaign performance using GA4, GTM, Google Search Console, and reporting tools\n\n• Analyze KPIs including CPL, ROAS, Conversion Rate, and Lead Quality\n\n• Collaborate with sales, content, design, and development teams to achieve business goals\n\n🔹 Required Skills:\n\n✔ 5+ years of hands-on Digital Marketing experience\n\n✔ Strong expertise in Google Ads and Performance Marketing\n\n✔ Experience managing international campaigns (US, UK, Europe, Middle East, etc.)\n\n✔ Proven experience in B2B lead generation, preferably in IT/Software Services\n\n✔ Strong knowledge of SEO, Social Media Marketing, and Conversion Optimization\n\n✔ Hands-on experience with Google Analytics 4 (GA4), Google Tag Manager (GTM), Google Search Console, CRM, and Marketing Automation Platforms\n\n✔ Excellent analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills\n\n🌍 Preferred:\n\n• Experience working with international IT service markets\n\n• Knowledge of AI-powered marketing tools and automation platforms\n\n• Experience in Account-Based Marketing (ABM)\n\nInterested candidates may send their resume to hr@jachoos.com/ susan@jachoos.com",
