    workDetails: "Position: Video Editor & Motion Graphic Designer\n\nExperience: 2+ Year\n\nLocation: Infopark, Cochin\n\nEmployment Type: Full-time\n\nWork Timing : 11am to 8pm IST\n\nAbout the Role:-\n\nWe are looking for a creative and detail-oriented Video Editor with 2+ years of professional experience to join our team. The ideal candidate should be passionate about visual storytelling and possess strong expertise in video editing, motion graphics, and content creation for digital platforms.\n\nThe candidate will be responsible for producing engaging video content for social media, marketing campaigns, product storytelling, advertisements, and brand communication while ensuring high-quality output aligned with brand guidelines.\n\nKey Responsibilities:-\n\nEdit high-quality video content for social media, digital marketing campaigns, advertisements, product demos, and branded content.\n\nCreate compelling motion graphics, transitions, titles, and visual effects.\n\nCollaborate with marketing, creative, and content teams to understand campaign objectives and deliver impactful visual assets.\n\nHandle video cutting, color correction, audio synchronization, sound design, and final rendering/export optimization.\n\nCreate short-form and long-form video content optimized for multiple platforms such as Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, and other digital channels.\n\nUtilize AI-powered video creation and editing tools to improve productivity, automation, and creative output.\n\nMaintain consistency in visual style, branding, and storytelling across all content.\n\nRequired Skills & Tools\n\nTechnical Skills:-\n\nVideo Editing\n\nMotion Graphics\n\nVisual Storytelling\n\nColor Correction\n\nAudio Synchronization\n\nSound Design\n\nSocial Media Content Creation\n\nBrand Communication\n\nTools:-\n\nAdobe Premiere Pro\n\nAdobe After Effects\n\nAdobe Photoshop\n\nAI-powered Video Editing Tools\n\nQualifications:-\n\nMinimum 2 year of professional experience in video editing and motion graphics.\n\nStrong portfolio showcasing creative video projects.\n\nGood understanding of social media trends and digital content formats.\n\n If this opportunity aligns with your career goals, kindly share your updated resume with us at career@newagesysindia.com",
